            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "<h2 id=\"dataset-description\">Dataset Description</h2>\n<p>The description and details of the methodology including the computational framework and data analysis together with the data and file usage is described in the original Github repository: <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/MaastrichtU-IDS/clean-technologies-nlp/tree/master/notebooks/README.md\">Data Analysis Description</a></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> Please mind that this repository only contains the resulting dataset that the article refers to additionally to its codebook. The analysis and all the data processing methods are in the original Github repository at:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MaastrichtU-IDS/clean-technologies-nlp\">github.com/MaastrichtU-IDS/clean-technologies-nlp</a></p>"
